# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [1.1.1] - 2024-12-30

### Fixed

- Removed `FlowResult` type hints that caused "Invalid handler specified" error in some Home Assistant versions
- Improved compatibility with Home Assistant 2025.x

## [1.1.0] - 2024-12-30

### Added

- **Button entities** for better integration control:
  - `button.actualiser_les_donnees` - Manual refresh button
  - `button.exporter_en_yaml` - Export button that creates notification with download link
- **Select entity** for configuration:
  - `select.intervalle_de_mise_a_jour` - Configure automatic update interval directly from dashboard
- Entity-based configuration instead of UI options flow
- Persistent notifications for export with direct download links

### Changed

- **BREAKING**: Removed custom Lovelace card in favor of native Home Assistant entities
- Simplified configuration interface to show statistics only
- All configuration now done via entities (select, buttons)
- Updated documentation to reflect entity-based approach
- Improved user experience with native HA controls

### Removed

- Custom Lovelace card (`listing-homeassistant-card`)
- Frontend JavaScript file
- Static path registration complexity
- CARD_DOCUMENTATION.md (no longer needed)

### Fixed

- ConfigFlow compatibility issues with Home Assistant 2025.x
- Static path registration errors
- Import issues with HomeAssistantView

### Technical Changes

- Added Button platform support
- Added Select platform support
- Simplified manifest.json (removed frontend configuration)
- Cleaner code architecture without custom card complexity

## [1.0.0] - 2024-12-29

### Added

- Initial release of Listing Home Assistant integration
- Support for listing all Home Assistant devices
- Support for listing all entities grouped by domain
- Support for listing automations with last triggered time
- Support for listing scripts
- Support for listing scenes
- Support for listing input entities (input_boolean, input_number, etc.)
- Dedicated sensors for each type of data:
  - `sensor.listing_home_assistant_devices`
  - `sensor.listing_home_assistant_entities`
  - `sensor.listing_home_assistant_automations`
  - `sensor.listing_home_assistant_scripts`
  - `sensor.listing_home_assistant_scenes`
  - `sensor.listing_home_assistant_inputs`
  - `sensor.listing_home_assistant_summary`
- Manual refresh service: `listing_homeassistant.refresh`
- Configurable automatic refresh interval:
  - Every hour (default)
  - Every 6 hours
  - Every 12 hours
  - Every day
- YAML export functionality with download handler
- Direct download URL: `/api/listing_homeassistant/download`
- Sorted and structured YAML export format
- Material Design icons for better UX
- French and English translations
- HACS compatibility
- Comprehensive documentation

